(1. The purpose of this Report is to confirm, so far as reasonably practicable, whether or not the electrical installation is in a satisfactory condition for continued service) Tj
T* (\(see Section 5\). The Report should identify any damage, deterioration, defects and/or conditions which may give rise to danger.) Tj
